      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHINY PISTOL (7) jumps from box 7 again after placing (16.96) last time at this track over 300m. Speedy runner who can find the front with a clear break from out wide. Expected to feature again. SOKAI (4) has a terrific record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from five starts. Hit the frame latest (16.80) when second at this track in a Other. Can feature with the right run. STORM SISTER (8) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 3 lengths (16.91) at Murray Bridge. Solid record here at the distance winning six races. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from seven starts. Should be about the money. RIO HOPE (2) is always hard to beat when she races at this trip.",
